1761257783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unleash your feral instincts in visceral melee combat, explore corrupted landscapes, and unravel a cosmic mystery threatening all life. Reclaim your honor and restore balance to the realm.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/df86d18dab6098024f00554ea3f0dd56.avif?t=1761257783\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/b9760ecb7ce1c76fa9bde9f730687075.poster.avif?t=1761257783\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/b9760ecb7ce1c76fa9bde9f730687075.webm?t=1761257783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/b9760ecb7ce1c76fa9bde9f730687075.mp4?t=1761257783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Traverse corrupted lush forests, highlands, villages and plains, uncovering secrets, lore, and crafting resources. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/904963e7ac8a91ebde07e2d5e827320e.avif?t=1761257783\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/845a43518a59618d3e8f72cc9193dcc7.poster.avif?t=1761257783\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512550/extras/845a43518a59618d3e8f72cc9193dcc7.webm?t=1761257783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto